{"id":"vod_md_2498","vodId":"2498","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"虫师","name_cn":"虫师","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230815-1/e6fe34a4463dcb6f3d97d523bfc20442.jpg"},"summary":"“虫”既不是动物，也不是微生物，而是一种自然界中无处不在的力量，拥有独特的生命形态，偶尔和人类生命产生交汇，便生出一些奇妙的故事。但人们即使得知了“虫”的存在，大部分时候也不知如何应对，这便需要“虫师”出马。银古就是一位虫师，他一头银发，年纪尚轻，但已经半生游历，经过一个个山野、村庄，为人们解决“虫”的问题，通过和被“虫”困扰的人们接近，他也接近了许多故事。银古的游历像风一样，再惊心动魄的“虫”似乎都融化在水墨样的山峦叠嶂间，芸芸众生也是过眼云烟，淡淡的故事里没有哀伤只有静穆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-15 07:41:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/9FHvQiu7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/jmBOTCNM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/2gM2UWUV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/eet2Gw2n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/eiYDDpYh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/Hz3pTxYy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/n7kpTAH9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/bu9NvTv1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/BOEk79XS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/J1i0VWyz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/ry60FTyh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/97UEfDjj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/2yZFmkcu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/Yl5yzME3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/QscW2SSq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/sua